SQL> @user_grant_sync.sql TEMPLATE_USER NEW_USER
--- SYNC SYSTEM PRIVILEGES ---
GRANT CREATE VIEW TO NEW_USER
--- SYNC OBJECT PRIVILEGES ---
GRANT SELECT ON HR.EMPLOYEES TO NEW_USER
REVOKE INSERT ON HR.DEPARTMENTS FROM NEW_USER
--- SYNC ROLES ---
GRANT APP_READONLY TO NEW_USER
--- SYNC TABLESPACE QUOTAS ---
ALTER USER NEW_USER QUOTA UNLIMITED ON USERS
--- SYNC COMPLETE ---

PL/SQL procedure successfully completed.
